<i>Tonight, a</i> 60 Minutes <i>exclusive.</i>

5
00:00:20,020 --> 00:00:22,772
<i>Ten years ago,
no one on Earth was aware</i>

6
00:00:22,773 --> 00:00:24,815
<i>we were already
under the protection</i>

7
00:00:24,816 --> 00:00:28,319
<i>of someone
calling himself Green Lantern.</i>

8
00:00:28,320 --> 00:00:31,697
<i>Then, without warning,
he made himself known,</i>

9
00:00:31,698 --> 00:00:36,327
