10
00:00:36,328 --> 00:00:39,039
<i>Or, at least,
he made himself partially known.</i>

11
00:00:40,332 --> 00:00:44,001
<i>Here now, we bring you
the first ever heart-to-heart</i>

12
00:00:44,002 --> 00:00:45,379
