00:24:05,778 --> 00:24:07,613
bones, teeth, heart,
the whole deal.

479
00:24:08,113 --> 00:24:09,323
And it says to me...

480
00:24:11,325 --> 00:24:12,660
"Are you afraid?"

481
00:24:13,911 --> 00:24:15,120
I say, "No.

482
00:24:16,330 --> 00:24:17,914
I'm not afraid."

483
00:24:17,915 --> 00:24:19,083
Wham!

484
00:24:19,917 --> 00:24:21,417
Yanks me out the window
across the sky

485
00:24:21,418 --> 00:24:22,710
