486
00:24:22,711 --> 00:24:24,837
Couple hundred miles
in about ten seconds.

487
00:24:24,838 --> 00:24:27,006
(CHUCKLES) I fly fighter jets.

488
00:24:27,007 --> 00:24:29,092
I have an excellent sense
of airspeed and bearing.

489
00:24:29,093 --> 00:24:30,259
That's how I know exactly

490
00:24:30,260 --> 00:24:32,096
where that green bubble
set me down.

491
00:24:32,638 --> 00:24:33,805
Nebraska.

492
00:24:33,806 --> 00:24:36,432
HAL: Not more than 20 miles
from where we sit right now.

493
00:24:36,433 --> 00:24:39,310
Which is middle
of fucking nowhere.

494
00:24:39,311 --> 00:24:41,730
Thus, an excellent place
to crash a spaceship.

495
00:24:44,566 --> 00:24:45,609
There he was.

496
00:24:46,318 --> 00:24:47,319
Right in front of me.

497
00:24:47,861 --> 00:24:48,779
The pilot.

498
00:24:49,738 --> 00:24:51,447
Bonafide fucking alien.

499
00:24:51,448 --> 00:24:54,450
Pink and bald, coughing up
glow-in-the-dark blood.

500
00:24:54,451 --> 00:24:56,911
- It was pretty fucking intense.
- ♪ (SONG CONCLUDES) ♪

501
00:24:56,912 --> 00:24:58,705
(JUKEBOX CLICKING)

