516
00:25:42,374 --> 00:25:45,335
Hell no, I didn't.
And then he said two more words,

517
00:25:46,045 --> 00:25:47,837
his last words.

518
00:25:47,838 --> 00:25:49,338
And he kind of whispered 'em,

519
00:25:49,339 --> 00:25:51,507
so I'm never really sure
whether he said "Good luck"

520
00:25:51,508 --> 00:25:53,134
or "Ah, fuck."

521
00:25:53,135 --> 00:25:55,762
Anyway, it turns out
Earth's way off grid,

522
00:25:55,763 --> 00:25:59,015
out of their jurisdiction.
Galactic fucking backwater.

523
00:25:59,016 --> 00:26:01,518
A human getting a ring,
isn't it a fucking fluke?

524
00:26:03,604 --> 00:26:05,730
The big, blue bosses,
they'd never wanted any Lantern

525
00:26:05,731 --> 00:26:07,441
coming near
our little shithole planet.

526
00:26:08,692 --> 00:26:10,860
And that's why my gut
always told me

527
00:26:10,861 --> 00:26:13,154
that crash was no accident.

528
00:26:13,155 --> 00:26:15,823
When it says
there's a shitstorm en route,

529
00:26:15,824 --> 00:26:17,283
I make sure there's a lookout

530
00:26:17,284 --> 00:26:19,077
