when it's fucking coming.

531
00:26:19,078 --> 00:26:20,537
The Halogram.

532
00:26:22,372 --> 00:26:24,207
Halogram.
(CHUCKLES) That's clever.

533
00:26:24,208 --> 00:26:25,291
Hmm. Thank you.

534
00:26:25,292 --> 00:26:27,168
- Hm. It's not that clever.
- ♪ (SONG CONCLUDES) ♪

535
00:26:27,169 --> 00:26:29,545
- (JUKEBOX CLICKING)
- ♪ ("BRAND NEW KEY"
BY MELANIE PLAYING FROM START) ♪

536
00:26:29,546 --> 00:26:32,216
PATRON: Hey, Jordan! Ass-face!

537
00:26:33,008 --> 00:26:34,175
You ignoring me?

538
00:26:34,176 --> 00:26:36,803
So help me God, if that song
plays one more time,

539
