610
00:29:25,847 --> 00:29:27,808
<i>♪ Wanna be around, girl ♪</i>

611
00:29:28,976 --> 00:29:32,228
<i>♪ Ooh, wanna be around... ♪</i>

612
00:29:32,229 --> 00:29:34,021
OFFICER: Let's go.
Let's go, sweetness.

613
00:29:34,022 --> 00:29:35,274
KERRY: Get him out of here!

614
00:29:35,899 --> 00:29:37,316
OFFICER: Yeah, yeah.

615
00:29:37,317 --> 00:29:38,902
Nice talking to you, stranger.

616
00:29:41,405 --> 00:29:42,655
I'm John.

617
00:29:42,656 --> 00:29:44,241
Walk me to my truck, John?

618
00:29:45,492 --> 00:29:50,747
<i>♪ By myself
I don't want nobody else ♪</i>

619
00:29:51,790 --> 00:29:54,583
<i>♪ The world leaves
A bitter taste ♪</i>

620
00:29:54,584 --> 00:29:56,585
<i>♪ In my mouth, girl ♪</i>

621
00:29:56,586 --> 00:29:59,256
<i>♪ You're the only one
That I want ♪</i>

622
00:30:00,590 --> 00:30:03,342
<i>- ♪ Wanna be around ♪</i>
- (STRANGER MOANS)

623
00:30:03,343 --> 00:30:08,472
<i>♪ Ooh ♪</i>

624
00:30:08,473 --> 00:30:11,518
<i>♪ Wanna be around, girl... ♪</i>

625
00:30:12,561 --> 00:30:14,062
You gonna give me a lecture?

626
00:30:14,771 --> 00:30:15,647
(SOFTLY) No.

627
00:30:17,190 --> 00:30:18,817
I'm gonna give you a light.

628
00:30:19,943 --> 00:30:22,654
<i>- ♪ Ooh, wanna be around ♪</i>
- (RING WARBLING)

629
00:30:25,449 --> 00:30:26,950
<i>- ♪ Baby, baby ♪</i>
- ♪ (SONG CONCLUDES) ♪

630
00:30:32,247 --> 00:30:34,498
KERRY: Because no comment
means no comment.

631
00:30:34,499 --> 00:30:35,666
(LOCK BUZZING)

632
00:30:35,667 --> 00:30:37,960
KERRY: I'm not gonna talk
about an active investigation,

633
00:30:37,961 --> 00:30:40,629
- you know that.
- (TELEPHONE RINGING)

634
00:30:40,630 --> 00:30:42,214
KERRY: Okay.

635
00:30:42,215 --> 00:30:43,300
- Good.
- (DOOR CLOSES)

636
00:30:44,217 --> 00:30:45,719
Tell Barb I said hey.

637
00:30:46,928 --> 00:30:48,804
(PHONE CLATTERS)

638
00:30:48,805 --> 00:30:51,183
I take it you're here
to bail out your buddy?

639
00:30:51,725 --> 00:30:52,975
Want some coffee?

640
00:30:52,976 --> 00:30:55,645
JOHN: I am,
and, um, no thank you.

641
00:30:56,188 --> 00:30:57,480
He's in a bit of a mood

642
