with my ring

1059
00:49:09,572 --> 00:49:11,489
and walk out of here
without a scratch.

1060
00:49:11,490 --> 00:49:12,740
You've been here 48 hours.

1061
00:49:12,741 --> 00:49:14,743
Did you bring the lantern
to recharge your ring?

1062
00:49:16,912 --> 00:49:18,080
I have plenty of power.

1063
00:49:18,998 --> 00:49:21,375
Hmm. But for how much longer?

1064
00:49:24,503 --> 00:49:25,421
Yeah.

1065
00:49:31,010 --> 00:49:32,260
<i>You should be asking yourself</i>

1066
