<i>if I'm capable of releasing
enough energy</i>

1067
00:49:34,054 --> 00:49:35,639
<i>to eradicate this entire town.</i>

1068
00:49:37,808 --> 00:49:41,102
We talking or exploding?
Because it's almost lunchtime.

1069
00:49:41,103 --> 00:49:42,396
(HANDCUFFS RATTLE)

1070
00:49:44,523 --> 00:49:46,442
It almost seems like you...

1071
