your precious oath?

1073
00:49:53,365 --> 00:49:55,658
"In brightest day
and blackest night..."

1074
00:49:55,659 --> 00:49:57,243
- HAL: Don't.
- "...no evil

1075
00:49:57,244 --> 00:49:58,703
- shall escape my sight."
- Shut your mouth.

1076
00:49:58,704 --> 00:50:01,122
WAYLON: "Let those
who worship evil's might

1077
00:50:01,123 --> 00:50:02,957
- beware my power...
- I said don't.

1078
00:50:02,958 --> 00:50:05,753
(CHUCKLES)
...Green Lantern's light."

1079
