1084
00:50:19,767 --> 00:50:21,769
- No, it's too late.
<i>- Why are you here?</i>

1085
00:50:22,645 --> 00:50:23,771
WAYLON: <i>Why else?</i>

1086
00:50:24,396 --> 00:50:25,522
<i>Vengeance.</i>

1087
00:50:25,523 --> 00:50:27,982
